 for me","youtube_link":null,"main_deck":"[\"88264978\",\"88264978\",\"67300516\",\"67300516\",\"33420078\",\"44330098\",\"75500286\",\"75500286\",\"77565204\",\"32807846\",\"81439173\",\"19613556\",\"42703248\",\"87910978\",\"44095762\",\"53582587\",\"41420027\",\"66214679\",\"66214679\",\"66214679\",\"48453776\",\"92719314\",\"92719314\",\"92719314\",\"65192027\",\"67300516\",\"14536035\",\"14536035\",\"30312361\",\"30312361\",\"30312361\",\"4906301\",\"33508719\",\"1475311\",\"70368879\",\"38120068\",\"38120068\",\"38120068\",\"72302403\",\"72892473\"]","extra_deck":"[\"99267150\",\"39402797\",\"27315304\",\"88643579\",\"44508094\",\"70780151\",\"23693634\",\"25862681\",\"73580471\",\"7391448\",\"50321796\",\"19974580\",\"43385557\",\"26593852\",\"29071332\"]","edit_date":null,"deck_views":127,"deckNum":737579,"comments":0,"cover_card":"88264978","deck_price":"100.39","pretty_url":"sky-scourge-737579","rating":null,"ratingq":null,"format":"Edison Format Decks","common":120,"rare":360,"super":390,"ultra":780,"img_url":"https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/users/default/default.jpg","submit_date":"1 day ago","tournamentPlayerName":null,"tournamentName":null,"tournamentPlayerCount":null,"tournamentPlayerCountIsApproximate":null,"tournamentPlacement":null,"userid":276050},{"username":"Esparanta","deck_name":"Winds of Exodia","deck_description":"<p>Hey!&nbsp;This deck was made as a tribute to Jeff Leonard, who won with Exodia in a clever way. Here, you will see the similar pattern but instead of Pendulums, Level 3 monsters will do it. If you don't know how to use them, check <a href=\"/deck/winds-of-star-birdman-735909\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>this</strong></a> deck!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZF-T89xtrKw\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Gameplan</strong></p><p>1) Before getting rid of Gabonga, don't forget to replace it with Fortress to get a Spell for Monk usage, which is \"Unveiling Mail\".</p><p>2) Use Monk to place Ferret and replace Ferret with Conjurer + Chlamy + Lilith. Then, replace Saryuja with Zealantis to reset the board. After the reset, activate Conjurer to get a Spell named \"Magical Dimension\" and use Lilith to set Chain Material.</p><p>3) Reuse Monk to place Mark and find Temple. Also, Link Summon Selene to place Monk again. Depending on your opening hand, here is what you should bring via Monk...</p><ul><li>If you have head of Exodia, place Blue Dragon Summoner.</li><li>If you don't have head of Exodia, place Witch of the Black Forest.</li></ul><p>4) After the activation of Temple + Chain, use Chlamy to place Ambulo by using 2 x Chlamy as materials. When Ambulo is here, you can search another Spell called \"Predapruning\" and tribute Blue/Witch via Ambulo to place Cobra. Besides Cobra searching \"Fusion Gate\" to unlock your Fusion setup, based on what you have put in #3, here is what you can search...</p><ul><li>Blue Dragon Summoner &gt;&gt;&gt; Limbs of Exodia</li><li>Witch of the Black Forest &gt;&gt;&gt; Head of Exodia</li></ul><p>5) To search all Exodia pieces, Selene has to be reused at most four more times to win the duel on the spot! In order to do so, here is the play pattern via Gate...</p><ul><li>Electrum#1</li><li>Chorozo = Electrum#1 + Mark</li><li>Augo = Aleister + Chorozo &gt;&gt;&gt; Banish Ambulo in GY whenever possible</li><li>Elysium = Augo + Selene &gt;&gt;&gt; Banish Electrum#1</li><li>Electrum#2 &gt;&gt;&gt; Recover Electrum#1 + Chorozo + Augo + (Ambulo) + Elysium + Selene + Mark + Aleister</li></ul><p>6) When you have played Electrum#2, that means you can replay Selene to place Monk and Monk can place Blue. From hereon, whenever you Link Summon Selene, you can only place Blue because you have used last Spell for Monk usage, which was \"Predapruning\". Since the repeated pattern in #5 leaves Blue onboard anyhow, Link Summoning Selene with Blue as material in mind can find you limbs of Exodia regardless.</p><p>7) Repeat what was explained in #5 and #6 until you win the duel with Exodia!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you wonder how to save up some SR and UR points, I can show you:</p><p>- \"Xyz Armor Fortress\" can be found by purchasing \"Rage of Deep Blue\" Structure Deck to save 30 SR!</p><p>- \"Dugg Charger\" + \"Wind-Up Magician\" + \"Wind-Up Shark\" + \"Grand Entrance\" + \"Zenmaity\" + \"Zenmaintenance\" + \"Big Gabonga\" can be found within \"Bonkers Bikers' Wild Wheels\" Secret Pack to save 240 SR and 120 UR!</p><p>- \"Exodia the Forbidden One\" can be found within either \"Fires of Infinity\" or \"The Great Olds\" Secret Packs to save 30 SR!</p><p>- \"Lilith, Lady of Lament\" can be either found within \"Illusion Beast's Roar\" or \"Rulers of Darkness\" Secret Packs to save 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Predaplant Ambulomelides\" can be found within \"Ravenous Invasive Flora\" Secret Pack to save 30 SR!</p><p>- \"Speedroid Terrortop\" can be found within \"Warp-Speed Toys\" Secret Pack to save 90 SR!</p><p>- \"Materiactor Gigadra\" can be found within \"Transmigration Reactor\" Secret Pack to save 90 SR!</p><p>- \"Doomed Soleret\" can be found within \"Indomitable Knights\" Secret Pack to save 90 SR!</p><p>- \"Aleister the Invoker\" + \"Invoked Elysium\" can be found within \"Master of Forbidden Spells\" Secret Pack to save 30 SR and 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Summoner Monk\" can be found within \"True Awakening of the Oathbound Knights\" Secret Pack to save 30 SR!</p><p>- \"The Man with the Mark\" + \"Temple of the Kings\" can be found within \"Infernal Labyrinth of No Escape\" Secret Pack to save 30 SR and 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Worldsea Dragon Zealantis\" can be found within \"Raging God of the Sea\" Secret Pack to save 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Primathmech Alembertian\" can be found within \"Supreme Strike\" Secret Pack to save 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Elemental HERO Electrum\" can be found within \"Legacy Pack\" to save 60 SR!</p><p>- \"Selene, Queen of the Master Magicians\" can be found within \"Knowledge of the Mythlords\" Secret Pack to save 30 UR!</p><p>- \"Magistus Chorozo\" can be found within \"Great Propheseers\" Secret Pack to save 30 UR!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, in total, you can save up to 750 SR and 330 UR, if you are willing to spend some gems. Other SR and UR cards I didn't mention are essential.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's all for this one. If you have any questions, feel free to ask. Have fun in Master Duel!</p>","deck_excerpt":"Exodia FTK ft. Wind-Up + Goblin","youtube_link":null,"main_deck":"[\"8124921\",\"44519536\",\"70903634\",\"7902349\",\"21844576\",\"58932615\",\"84327329\",\"77683371\",\"89181134\",\"89181134\",\"33396948\",\"2460565\",\"2460565\",\"2460565\",\"57962537\",\"19353570\",\"19353570\",\"19353570\",\"81275020\",\"81275020\",\"81275020\",\"53932291\",\"61677004\",\"58582979\",\"23898021\",\"33008376\",\"33008376\",\"33008376\",\"24079759\",\"64257161\",\"83566725\",\"83566725\",\"83566725\",\"78010363\",\"79979666\",\"423585\",\"59297550\",\"59297550\",\"59297550\",\"25484449\",\"25484449\",\"25484449\",\"55969226\",\"86120751\",\"56343672\",\"97522863\",\"85852291\",\"85852291\",\"85852291\",\"90711610\",\"14463695\",\"68663427\",\"33550694\",\"29762407\",\"28553439\",\"69320362\",\"39980304\",\"39980304\",\"39980304\",\"85257384\"]","extra_deck":"[\"66532962\",\"66309175\",\"97300502\",\"29343734\",\"29343734\",\"11270236\",\"81122844\",\"81122844\",\"34001672\",\"85692042\",\"20145685\",\"1735088\",\"45819647\",\"74997493\",\"45112597\"]","edit_date":"1 day ago","deck_views":190,"deckNum":737577,"comments":0,"cover_card":"33396948","deck_price":"66.12","pretty_url":"winds-of-exodia-737577","rating":null,"ratingq":null,"format":"Master Duel Decks","common":420,"rare":660,"super":810,"ultra":360,"img_url":"https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/users/154160/154160.jpg","submit_date":"1 day ago","tournamentPlayerName":null,"tournamentName":null,"tournamentPlayerCount":null,"tournamentPl